OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785872169
OL,3,CDriver caught at 90mph in 30mph zone
OL,4,Cin speeding crackdown
OL,6,FPolice in Northern Ireland detected a
OL,7,Fvehicle travelling at 90mph in a 30mph
OL,8,Fzone during a crackdown on speeding
OL,9,Fand traffic offences.
OL,11,FA senior officer has said there needs
OL,12,Fto be a "societal attitude change"
OL,13,Ftowards speeding on the roads in the
OL,14,Fregion.
OL,16,FThe PSNI five-day operation resulted
OL,17,Fin 2,132 speeding detections and 308
OL,18,Ftraffic offences.
OL,26,@tD@IOUtD@bO]
