OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785872169
OL,3,CDriver caught at 90mph in 30mph zone
OL,4,Cin speeding crackdown
OL,6,FThe Operation Lifesaver crackdown ran
OL,7,Fbetween July 27 and 31 and included
OL,8,Fthe deployment of Northern Ireland
OL,9,FRoad Safety Partnership safety camera
OL,10,Fvans.
OL,12,FOne driver was detected at 62mph on a
OL,13,F30mph stretch of the Tandragee Road in
OL,14,FPoyntzpass and another at 81mph on the
OL,15,F40mph Knockbreda carriageway in
OL,16,FBelfast.
OL,18,FA driver was also caught speeding at
OL,19,F90mph on the A2 Garron Road in
OL,20,FGlenariff in Co Antrim in a 30mph zone.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785872169
OL,3,CDriver caught at 90mph in 30mph zone
OL,4,Cin speeding crackdown
OL,6,FAnother motorist was caught speeding
OL,7,Fat 105mph on the 60mph Belfast Road,
OL,8,FNutts Corner.
OL,10,FPolice also made 59 detections for
OL,11,Fcareless driving, 45 for no insurance,
OL,12,F57 for construction and use, 18 drink
OL,13,For drug driving detections, 18 for not
OL,14,Fwearing a seatbelt and 15 for using a
OL,15,Fmobile phone while driving.
OL,17,FChief Inspector Celeste Simpson said:
OL,18,F"Despite repeated police appeals for
OL,19,Fmotorists to slow down, there are
OL,20,Fstill drivers speeding.
OL,26,@zD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785872169
OL,3,CDriver caught at 90mph in 30mph zone
OL,4,Cin speeding crackdown
OL,6,F"There are still drivers who are not
OL,7,Fheeding our fatal five messaging,
OL,8,Fdrivers who think it's okay to drink-
OL,9,Fdrive, to not wear a seatbelt, to
OL,10,Fdrive an uninsured car or use your
OL,11,Fphone while driving.
OL,13,F"Anyone who speeds, who commits any of
OL,14,Fthese offences, is putting their life
OL,15,Fand the lives of others at risk."
OL,17,FShe added: "It's unacceptable, and
OL,18,Fthere has to be a societal attitude
OL,19,Fchange towards speeding and road
OL,20,Fsafety in general.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUwD@aO]yD@LOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785872169
OL,3,CDriver caught at 90mph in 30mph zone
OL,4,Cin speeding crackdown
OL,6,F"The attitude 'it's not really a
OL,7,Fcrime', or 'the worst won't happen to
OL,8,Fme' has to change and people have to
OL,9,Ftake personal responsibility for their
OL,10,Factions.
OL,12,F"Drivers must think (about) what they
OL,13,Fneed to do to keep themselves and
OL,14,Fevery other road user safe."
OL,16,FSince the start of 2026, 44 people
OL,17,Fhave been killed on roads in Northern
OL,18,FIreland.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUvD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/7
