PN,41506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785872169
OL,3,CDriver caught at 90mph in 30mph zone
OL,4,Cin speeding crackdown
OL,6,FMs Simpson said: "These are more than
OL,7,Fstatistics. Each death is a
OL,8,Fcatastrophic loss, with too many
OL,9,Fpeople whose lives have been changed
OL,10,Fin an instant.
OL,12,F"Actions behind the wheel don't just
OL,13,Faffect the driver, they affect other
OL,14,Froad users too.
OL,16,F"Remember the Fatal Five ` slow down,
OL,17,Fstay off your phone, never drink or
OL,18,Fdrug drive, don't get distracted and
OL,19,Falways wear your seatbelt.
OL,26,@nD@ROUtD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/7
