PN,41507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785872169
OL,3,CDriver caught at 90mph in 30mph zone
OL,4,Cin speeding crackdown
OL,6,F"Making sure you do all you can as a
OL,7,Fdriver and road user to ensure your
OL,8,Fjourney is safe should be a priority
OL,9,Fat all times because the road is
OL,10,Fsomething we all share."
